  vertically abuts the wordmark band and lies anywhere to its right is flagged. Exact getBBox
  measurement (logs-raw/fig-u1-2-ur-bbox-measurement.txt):
    fig-U1-2.ur.svg      wordmark x=12.0..104.5 top=449.6 | caption x=420.4..764.0 bottom=452.3
    fig-U1-2.ur.dark.svg identical geometry
  The horizontal ranges [12,104.5] and [420.4,764] are disjoint: no visual overlap is possible.
  The English fig-U1-2.svg (caption left, wordmark right) is geometrically equivalent mirrored.
  Verdict: tool false positive; recorded as an advisory finding, not a figure defect.
  Element screenshots saved: render-inspect-ur/fig-U1-2-ur-full.png, fig-U1-2-ur-bottomband.png.

